type: software
title: "edi_kernels: Python bindings for the C++ model-fitting kernels of EDI (Experimental Design and Inference)"
version: 1.0.0.post5
date-released: "2026-08-30"
authors:
  - family-names: Kapelner
    given-names: Adam
