license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - experimental design
  - statistical inference
  - survival analysis
  - pybind11
  - Eigen
abstract: >
  edi_kernels provides Python bindings, via pybind11, to the same C++
  model-fitting kernels used by the EDI (Experimental Design and
  Inference) R package (github.com/kapelner/EDI)
  -- no R or Rcpp dependency. It exposes fast solvers for a range of
  regression and inference families (continuous, incidence, count,
  proportion, survival, ordinal) built on Eigen and LBFGS++.
